# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">03</span><span class="sec-icon">🏗️</span><h2>A medallion pipeline in SQL</h2></div><div class="code"><div class="code-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="lang">SQL</span><button class="copy" type="button">copy</button></div><pre><span style="color: #8B949E; font-style: italic">-- Bronze: incremental file ingestion with Auto Loader</span>
